{{Term/Store|Common Sparrow|Common Sparrows|Series, BotW, TotK|plural}} are recurring [[Creature]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref>{{Cite|'''Common Sparrow'''|Hyrule Compendium|BotW}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|'''Common Sparrow'''|Hyrule Compendium|TotK}}</ref>

==Characteristics==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Common Sparrow}}
Common Sparrows are a widespread and ubiquitous type of [[Sparrow]].<ref>{{Cite Book|quote= |book= CaC |publisher= |page= 164}}</ref> They can be seen throughout [[Hyrule]], though they chiefly inhabit forests and grasslands, such as [[Hyrule Field]] and [[Hyrule Ridge]].<ref name="Compendium">{{Cite|As the name suggests, these birds are rather common around Hyrule. They mainly live in plains or forests but sometimes venture out to villages. Their diet consists of nuts and small insects. They look pretty cute when they jump around, but they don't have much love for people.|Hyrule Compendium|BotW}}</ref> However, they are also known to occasionally enter villages.<ref name="Compendium"/> They are omnivorous, feeding primarily on nuts and small [[Insect]]s.<ref name="Compendium"/> While they are considered to be cute, they are extremely skittish and will fly away if disturbed by people.<ref name="Compendium"/> When they are killed, Common Sparrows drop [[Chickaloo Tree Nut]]s.

